<title>USA: Computer analyst Milunovich joins Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Computer analyst Milunovich joins Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch on Thursday said Steve Milunovich has joined the firm as senior analyst in their large computer systems area, replacing Dan Mandresh, who is retiring.</p>
<p>Milunovich was an analyst at Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p>Mandresh is expected to stay on briefly during the transition.</p>
<p>&quot;Steve will play a critical role in helping to leverage what is already some of the top technology research on the street,&quot; said Andrew Melnick, director of Merril Lynch Global Securites Research and Economics, in a statment.</p>
</text>
